    },
    "enUS": {
      "dialogue": {
        "14fed29884f7efc678e4": "The clothcraft of the Shen'dorei is a harmonious imitation of the flowing, carefree currents of the winds. While the spirits have left us, and I know not when I may see them dance once more... I find great comfort in my art, if only as a distraction.\n\nI can teach you to work the cloth as well, if you'd like to learn?"
      },
      "name": "Taleen Shimmerthread",
      "subName": "Tailor",
      "translationMetadata": {
        "fields": {
